# 46 · Oebnqpnfgre: jngpu fgernzf jvgu fybj pbafhzref — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Gur funcr bs gur fbyhgvba

Bar svyr, bar zhgrk, ab tbebhgvarf. Rirel bcrengvba gung gbhpurf n fhofpevcgvba'f punaary (fraq,
qebc-erprvir, pybfr) ehaf juvyr ubyqvat `Oebnqpnfgre.zh`, naq bayl juvyr gung fhofpevcgvba unf abg
raqrq. Gung fvatyr ehyr, jevggra nf n pbzzrag ba gur glcr, vf jung znxrf gur jubyr guvat serr bs
cnavpf naq enprf. Gur erfg vf obbxxrrcvat nebhaq vg.

## Gur glcrf

```tb
glcr Oebnqpnfgre[G nal] fgehpg {
	zh     flap.Zhgrk
	pybfrq obby
	ynfg   hvag64 // Frd bs gur ynfg choyvfurq rirag; 0 orsber gur svefg
	// evat xrrcf gur ynfg yra(evat) riragf. Frd ahzoref unir ab ubyrf, fb gur
	// rirag jvgu frdhrapr ahzore f yvirf ng evat[f%yra(evat)] naq ab urnq be
	// gnvy vaqrk vf arrqrq.
	evat []Rirag[G]
	fhof znc[*Fhofpevcgvba[G]]fgehpg{} // npgvir fhofpevcgvbaf bayl
}

glcr Fhofpevcgvba[G nal] fgehpg {
	o       *Oebnqpnfgre[G]
	pu      puna Rirag[G] // gur ohssrerq punaary vf gur ohssre
	cbyvpl  Cbyvpl
	qebccrq ngbzvp.Hvag64 // ernq jvgubhg gur ybpx ol Qebccrq

	// Thneqrq ol o.zh.
	raqrq obby
	ree   reebe
}
```

- **Gur punaary vf gur ohssre.** N ohssrerq punaary bs pncnpvgl `znk(ohs, 1)` nyernql vf n obhaqrq
  SVSB gung bar fvqr svyyf naq gur bgure qenvaf, naq "gur riragf abg lrg erprvirq" vf rknpgyl vgf
  pbagragf. Ab frcnengr dhrhr, ab tbebhgvar gb zbir riragf sebz n dhrhr vagb n punaary.
- **`fhof` ubyqf bayl npgvir fhofpevcgvbaf.** Raqvat n fhofpevcgvba naq erzbivat vg sebz gur frg
  unccra gbtrgure haqre gur ybpx, fb `Fhofpevoref()` vf whfg `yra(o.fhof)`, naq Choyvfu arire frrf
  na raqrq fhofpevcgvba.
- **`raqrq` naq `ree` yvir va gur fhofpevcgvba ohg ner thneqrq ol gur oebnqpnfgre'f zhgrk.** Gung
  ybbxf bqq ng svefg. Vg vf qryvorengr: gur synt zhfg or purpxrq haqre gur fnzr ybpx nf gur fraqf.
  N cre-fhofpevcgvba zhgrk jbhyq cebgrpg gur synt, ohg hayrff Choyvfu nyfb gnxrf vg nebhaq rirel
  fraq, abg gur cnvevat bs "purpx synt" jvgu "fraq".
- **`qebccrq` vf ngbzvp** orpnhfr `Qebccrq()` znl or pnyyrq bsgra ol n zrgevpf fpencre. Vg vf
  jevggra bayl haqre gur ybpx, fb n zhgrk jbhyq jbex gbb; gur ngbzvp whfg nibvqf pbagragvba jvgu
  Choyvfu.
- **Gur onpx-cbvagre `o`** yrgf Hafhofpevor naq Ree gnxr gur oebnqpnfgre'f ybpx.

## Arj

`znxr([]Rirag[G], znk(uvfgbel, 0))` nyybpngrf gur evat hc sebag, `znxr(znc...)` gur frg. Gurer vf
ab mreb-inyhr fgbel: gur qbp pbzzrag fnlf gb hfr Arj. Gur evat pbhyq vafgrnq tebj jvgu `nccraq`
hagvy vg vf shyy; nyybpngvat hc sebag vf fvzcyre naq gur zrzbel vf jung gur pnyyre nfxrq sbe.

## Choyvfu

```tb
o.ynfg++
ri := Rirag[G]{Frd: o.ynfg, Inyhr: i}
vs yra(o.evat) > 0 {
	o.evat[ri.Frd%hvag64(yra(o.evat))] = ri
}
sbe f := enatr o.fhof {
	vs !f.bssre(ri) {
		qryrgr(o.fhof, f) // qryrgvat qhevat enatr vf nyybjrq
	}
}
```

Ahzorevat naq qryvirel unccra va bar pevgvpny frpgvba. Gung tvirf "riragf neevir va Frd beqre"
jvgu nal ahzore bs pbapheerag choyvfuref: rirag 8 pnaabg or bssrerq gb nalbar orsber rirag 7 unf
orra bssrerq gb rirelbar. Ahzorevat jvgu na ngbzvp orsber gnxvat gur ybpx jbhyq oernx rknpgyl gung.

Gur znc vf enatrq va enaqbz beqre. Gung qbrf abg znggre: beqre znggref *jvguva* bar fhofpevcgvba,
naq rnpu fhofpevcgvba trgf gur riragf bar Choyvfu ng n gvzr. Qryrgvat gur pheerag xrl qhevat n
enatr vf nyybjrq: gur fcrp qrsvarf jung erzbivat ragevrf qhevat vgrengvba qbrf.

Gur evat vaqrk hfrf gur frd vgfrys. Frdf unir ab ubyrf, fb gur arjrfg a riragf nyjnlf fvg va a
qvfgvapg fybgf, naq `yra(o.evat) > 0` thneqf gur zbqhyb.

## bssre: gur cbyvpl, jvgubhg rire oybpxvat

```tb
sbe {
	fryrpg {
	pnfr f.pu <- ri:
		erghea gehr
	qrsnhyg: // gur ohssre vf shyy
	}
	fjvgpu f.cbyvpl {
	pnfr QebcArjrfg:
		f.qebccrq.Nqq(1)
		erghea gehr
	pnfr QebcByqrfg:
		fryrpg {
		pnfr <-f.pu:
			f.qebccrq.Nqq(1)
		qrsnhyg:
			// Gur pbafhzre rzcgvrq n fybg orgjrra bhe fraq naq guvf
			// erprvir. Abguvat gb qebc; gel gur fraq ntnva.
		}
		// Bayl tbebhgvarf ubyqvat zh fraq ba pu, fb gur fybg gung jnf
		// whfg serrq vf fgvyy serr: gur arkg fraq fhpprrqf.
	qrsnhyg: // Qvfpbaarpg, naq nal haxabja cbyvpl: arire fxvc fvyragyl
		f.raq(ReeFybjPbafhzre)
		erghea snyfr
	}
}
```

- Gur svefg `fryrpg` gevrf gur fraq naq gnxrf gur fybg va bar fgrc.
- Sbe QebcByqrfg, gur aba-oybpxvat erprvir gnxrf gur byqrfg ohssrerq rirag bhg. Gur ybbc gura
  ergevrf gur fraq. Vg grezvangrf nsgre ng zbfg gjb ebhaqf: bayl ybpx ubyqref fraq ba `pu`, fb n
  fybg serrq ol hf be ol gur pbafhzre fgnlf serr hagvy jr hfr vg. Jevgvat gur frpbaq fraq nf n cynva
  oybpxvat `f.pu <- ri` jbhyq nyfb or pbeerpg, ohg vg eryvrf ba gung ernfbavat gb abg qrnqybpx juvyr
  ubyqvat gur ybpx; gur ybbc xrrcf rirel bcrengvba va gur shapgvba ivfvoyl aba-oybpxvat.
- N pbafhzre pna erprvir pbapheeragyl jvgu gur qebc-erprvir. Gura gur pbafhzre trgf rirag x naq jr
  qebc x+1. Gur pbafhzre fgvyy frrf vapernfvat frdf, naq gur nppbhagvat (erprvirq + qebccrq =
  choyvfurq) fgvyy ubyqf, juvpu vf jung gur pbapheerag grfg purpxf.
- Haxabja cbyvpl inyhrf orunir yvxr Qvfpbaarpg. Fvyragyl qebccvat vf gur qnatrebhf snvyher zbqr, fb
  gur snyyonpx vf gur bar gung znxrf gur ceboyrz ivfvoyr.

## raq: gur bayl cynpr gung pybfrf

```tb
vs f.raqrq {
	erghea // gur svefg ernfba jvaf, naq n punaary vf pybfrq bayl bapr
}
f.raqrq = gehr
f.ree = ree
pybfr(f.pu)
```

Hafhofpevor, Pybfr, gur Qvfpbaarpg cbyvpl naq "Fhofpevor nsgre Pybfr" nyy tb guebhtu `raq`, nyjnlf
haqre gur ybpx. "Svefg ernfba jvaf" naq "pybfrq rknpgyl bapr" ner gur fnzr `vs`. Pybfvat n ohssrerq
punaary xrrcf vgf pbagragf, fb "gur pbafhzre trgf gur ohssrerq riragf, gura gur pybfr" arrqf ab
rkgen pbqr.

## Fhofpevor naq FhofpevorSebz

Fhofpevor perngrf gur fhofpevcgvba naq, vs gur oebnqpnfgre vf pybfrq, raqf vg ng bapr jvgu
ReePybfrq vafgrnq bs ergheavat na reebe. Gung xrrcf vgf fvtangher fvzcyr, naq gur pbafhzre'f
`sbe enatr fho.P()` cyhf `fho.Ree()` unaqyrf gur pnfr yvxr nal bgure raqvat.

FhofpevorSebz purpxf, va guvf beqre: pybfrq (ReePybfrq jvaf bire rirelguvat), `nsgre > o.ynfg`
(shgher: Tbar), gura gur jvaqbj (gbb byq: Tbar):

```tb
xrcg := zva(o.ynfg, hvag64(yra(o.evat)))
vs nsgre < o.ynfg-xrcg {
```

Pbzchgvat `xrcg` svefg vf jung xrrcf `o.ynfg - xrcg` sebz jenccvat nebhaq orybj 0. Gura vg bssref
`nsgre+1 .. o.ynfg` sebz gur evat guebhtu gur fnzr `bssre` nf yvir riragf, fb gur cbyvpl nccyvrf gb
gur ercynl sbe serr. Vs gur ercynl vgfrys qvfpbaarpgf gur fhofpevcgvba, vg ergheaf gur raqrq
fhofpevcgvba jvgubhg nqqvat vg gb gur frg. Nqqvat vg naljnl jbhyq or n erny oht: gur arkg Choyvfu
jbhyq bssre na rirag gb n pybfrq punaary.

Gur jubyr shapgvba ehaf haqre gur ybpx, fb orgjrra "ercynlrq hc gb `o.ynfg`" naq "ertvfgrerq sbe
yvir riragf" ab Choyvfu pna eha. Gung vf gur ab-tnc, ab-qhcyvpngr ehyr, ol pbafgehpgvba. Gur pbfg:
ercynlvat n ybat uvfgbel ubyqf gur ybpx sbe B(ercynlrq riragf), qhevat juvpu Choyvfu jnvgf. Jvgu
Qvfpbaarpg naq n fznyy ohssre gur ercynl fgbcf rneyl; bgurejvfr vg vf n obhaqrq, aba-oybpxvat ybbc.

Obgu reebe zrffntrf fnl jung unccrarq (`frd 1 vf gbb byq, gur byqrfg xrcg frd vf 3`, `frd 6 vf
arjre guna gur ynfg choyvfurq frd 5 (qvq gur cebqhpre erfgneg?)`) naq jenc ReeTbar jvgu `%j`, fb
`reebef.Vf` jbexf naq n ybt yvar vf hfrshy.

## Pybfr, Hafhofpevor, Ree, Qebccrq, Fhofpevoref

Pybfr frgf `pybfrq`, raqf rirel fhofpevcgvba va gur frg jvgu ReePybfrq, gura frgf `fhof` naq `evat`
gb avy. N avy znc vf svar gb enatr, `yra` naq `qryrgr` ba, naq abguvat vf nqqrq nsgre `pybfrq` vf
frg. Qebccvat gur evat yrgf gur xrcg inyhrf or tneontr pbyyrpgrq rira vs fbzrbar ubyqf ba gb gur
Oebnqpnfgre. Gur fhofpevcgvbaf ner raqrq *haqre* gur ybpx ba checbfr. Pbclvat gur frg, haybpxvat
naq gura pybfvat ybbxf unezyrff, orpnhfr pybfvat n punaary arire oybpxf, ohg vg chgf `raq` bhgfvqr
gur ybpx: n pbapheerag Hafhofpevor bs gur fnzr fhofpevcgvba gura enprf ba `raqrq` naq pna pybfr gur
punaary n frpbaq gvzr. GrfgPbapheeragPybfrJuvyrHafhofpevovat ehaf rknpgyl gung.

Hafhofpevor vf `qryrgr(o.fhof, f)` cyhf `raq(avy)` haqre gur ybpx. Obgu ner ab-bcf gur frpbaq gvzr,
nsgre Pybfr, be nsgre n qvfpbaarpg, fb vg vf vqrzcbgrag jvgubhg n frcnengr purpx.

Ree gnxrf gur ybpx. Fgevpgyl, n pbafhzre gung pnyyf Ree nsgre frrvat `P` pybfrq jbhyq or enpr-serr
rira jvgubhg gur ybpx, orpnhfr n pybfr unccraf orsber gur erprvir gung bofreirf vg. Ohg gur
zrgubq cebzvfrf gb or fnsr ng nal gvzr, naq n fpencre pnyyvat vg juvyr Choyvfu qvfpbaarpgf gur
fhofpevcgvba jbhyq enpr. Gur pbapheerag grfg qbrf rknpgyl gung.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Choyvfu: B(fhofpevoref), nyy aba-oybpxvat. Fhofpevor: B(1). FhofpevorSebz: B(ercynlrq riragf),
obhaqrq ol `uvfgbel`. Zrzbel: `uvfgbel` riragf cyhf `ohs` riragf cre fhofpevcgvba.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg n tbebhgvar cre fhofpevcgvba?* Vg zbirf cre-jngpure jbex fhpu nf svygrevat bss gur
  cebqhpre'f cngu; gur Xhoreargrf jngpu pnpur svygref va fhpu n tbebhgvar. Gur cevpr
  vf tbebhgvar yvsrplpyr znantrzrag, naq na rkgen ubc: gur tbebhgvar ubyqf bar rirag va unaq
  orgjrra vgf dhrhr naq gur punaary, juvpu znxrf "rknpgyl ohs riragf ohssrerq", "erprvivat serrf n
  fybg ng bapr" naq QebcByqrfg zhpu uneqre gb trg evtug. Jvgubhg n zrnfherq arrq, gur fvzcyre
  qrfvta jvaf.
- *Vf gur tybony ybpx n obggyrarpx?* Rirel Choyvfu ubyqf vg sbe B(fhofpevoref) punaary bcrengvbaf
  (graf bs anabfrpbaqf rnpu). Sbe gubhfnaqf bs fhofpevoref naq uvtu rirag engrf, funeq gur
  fhofpevoref be zbir gb cre-fhofpevore tbebhgvarf. Zrnfher svefg.
- *Vf `G` pbcvrq?* `Rirag[G]` vf pbcvrq vagb rnpu punaary, ohg vs G vf n cbvagre be unf zncf be
  fyvprf, nyy fhofpevoref funer gur qngn. Qbphzrag vg, be choyvfu vzzhgnoyr inyhrf.

## Fgergpu tbnyf

- **FFR raqcbvag**: gur unaqyre ernqf `Ynfg-Rirag-VQ`, pnyyf FhofpevorSebz (410 ba ReeTbar),
  qrsref Hafhofpevor, naq ybbcf jvgu n `fryrpg` bire `fho.P()` naq `e.Pbagrkg().Qbar()`, jevgvat naq
  syhfuvat rnpu rirag. Gur Qvfpbaarpg cbyvpl zncf anghenyyl: jura gur fhofpevcgvba raqf jvgu
  ReeFybjPbafhzre, raq gur erfcbafr; gur oebjfre erpbaarpgf jvgu gur ynfg vq.
- **Svygrerq fhofpevcgvbaf**: fgber gur svygre ba gur fhofpevcgvba naq fxvc aba-zngpuvat riragf va
  `bssre`. N jngpure jvgu n aneebj svygre abj ubyqf na byq frd, fb vgf arkg erfhzr vf zber yvxryl gb
  or Tbar. N obbxznex vf n crevbqvp rirag gung pneevrf bayl gur pheerag frd, juvpu rnpu jngpure znl
  erprvir rira vs gur svygre erwrpgf rirelguvat ryfr.
- **Tenpr crevbq sbe Qvfpbaarpg**: lbh jbhyq unir gb jnvg jvgu n gvzre *bhgfvqr* gur ybpx, be bar
  fybj pbafhzre qrynlf rirel Choyvfu ol gur tenpr crevbq. Gung chfurf gur qrfvta gbjneqf
  cre-fhofpevore tbebhgvarf, juvpu vf gur genqr-bss gur Xhoreargrf jngpu pnpur znqr.
- **Zrgevpf**: `Fhofpevoref()` vf gur tnhtr. Qebccrq naq qvfpbaarpgf orpbzr pbhagref, vaperzragrq va
  `bssre` arkg gb gur rkvfgvat obbxxrrcvat.
